<h2 class="text-secondary">Legislative Commission</h2><hr/>
<% id = modal('Functions of Legislative Commission', size: :lg) do %>
  <ol>
    <li>To formulate proposals to amend the SeqCode as deemed necessary or as
      requested by the SeqCode Community.</li>
    <li>To receive and arrange discussion of proposals to amend the
      SeqCode.</li>
    <li>To maintain the SeqCode as a publicly accessible ‘living document’ and
      arrange issuance of new editions at timely intervals.</li>
  </ol>
<% end %>
<p class="lead">
  The Legislative Commission is the only body authorized to amend the
  SeqCode.
  <%= modal_button(id, class: 'text-primary') do %>
    Functions of the Legislative Commission
  <% end %>.
</p>
